      "content": "staring at a white wall?? that actually made the headache a bit worse and now im feeling kinda nauseous. i really need to get this work done though, i dont have time to go to the clinic. should i just take some extra strength ibuprofen or something to kill the pain so i can focus? how much is safe to take all at once so i don't have to worry about it for the rest of the day?",
